{"id":"81368c4ce6d48f51","group":"20","path":"20/20-ex-naive-minimization.md","title":"忽略较小发散输入的最小化不保持可计算性","display":"ex-naive-minimization — 忽略较小发散输入的最小化不保持可计算性","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-ex-naive-minimization","aliases":["20-ex-naive-minimization"],"display":"ex-naive-minimization — 忽略较小发散输入的最小化不保持可计算性","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 1.6.28 的显式反例","source_printed_pages":[19],"source_pdf_pages":[55],"depends_on":["[[20-df-K]]","[[20-thm-K-undecidable]]","[[20-df-strict-minimization]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-ex-naive-minimization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-ex-naive-minimization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-naive-minimization — 忽略较小发散输入的最小化不保持可计算性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 1.6.28 的显式反例"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>19</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>55</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d18ba716e49ac8c6\" href=\"?note=d18ba716e49ac8c6\" title=\"20-thm-K-undecidable\">20-thm-K-undecidable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"13c94185789a6bef\" href=\"?note=13c94185789a6bef\" title=\"20-df-strict-minimization\">20-df-strict-minimization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\omega\">\\(x,y\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 为对角停机集。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d18ba716e49ac8c6\" href=\"?note=d18ba716e49ac8c6\" title=\"20-thm-K-undecidable\">20-thm-K-undecidable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"13c94185789a6bef\" href=\"?note=13c94185789a6bef\" title=\"20-df-strict-minimization\">20-df-strict-minimization</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}naive\\text{-}minimization}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\theta(x,y)\\simeq\\begin{cases}1&amp;y=1\\ \\lor\\ (y=0\\land x\\in K),\\\\ \\uparrow&amp;\\text{otherwise},\\end{cases}\\\\ m(x):=\\min\\{y:\\theta(x,y)\\downarrow=1\\}=\\begin{cases}0&amp;x\\in K,\\\\1&amp;x\\notin K,\\end{cases}\\qquad m\\notin\\mathcal C_1.\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}naive\\text{-}minimization}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\theta(x,y)\\simeq\\begin{cases}1&amp;y=1\\ \\lor\\ (y=0\\land x\\in K),\\\\ \\uparrow&amp;\\text{otherwise},\\end{cases}\\\\ m(x):=\\min\\{y:\\theta(x,y)\\downarrow=1\\}=\\begin{cases}0&amp;x\\in K,\\\\1&amp;x\\notin K,\\end{cases}\\qquad m\\notin\\mathcal C_1.\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>θ 是部分可计算：在 y=0 时等待 x 进入 K，y=1 时直接输出。m 处处存在；若它部分可计算便为全可计算，并以 m(x)=0 判定 K，矛盾。严格 Min₁ 在 x∉K 时因较小输入 0 发散而未定义，正是必要的区别。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 1.6.28 的显式反例；印刷页 19；PDF 第 55 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved","id":"0e6b2238da5572e4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-K]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"d18ba716e49ac8c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-K-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strict-minimization","status":"resolved","id":"13c94185789a6bef","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strict-minimization]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved","id":"0e6b2238da5572e4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]；see [[20-df-strict-minimization]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"d18ba716e49ac8c6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]；see [[20-df-strict-minimization]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strict-minimization","status":"resolved","id":"13c94185789a6bef","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]；see [[20-df-strict-minimization]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,y\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}naive\\text{-}minimization}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\theta(x,y)\\simeq\\begin{cases}1&y=1\\ \\lor\\ (y=0\\land x\\in K),\\\\ \\uparrow&\\text{otherwise},\\end{cases}\\\\ m(x):=\\min\\{y:\\theta(x,y)\\downarrow=1\\}=\\begin{cases}0&x\\in K,\\\\1&x\\notin K,\\end{cases}\\qquad m\\notin\\mathcal C_1.\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1586,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["0e6b2238da5572e4","d18ba716e49ac8c6","13c94185789a6bef","e343870c773cb68e"]}